**Request \[[Create API Key](https://ultracart.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ucdoc/pages/38688545/API+Simple+Key)\]**
```bash
curl -X POST "https://secure.ultracart.com/rest/v2/customer/customers/1901934/store_credit" \
  -H "Accept: application/json" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8" \
  -H "X-UltraCart-Api-Version: 2017-03-01" \
  -H "x-ultracart-simple-key: 9ba531f25214860199e2f539c3800100992dc2bbaeb40d0199e2f539c3800100" \
  -d $'{
    "amount": 20.0,
    "description": "Customer is super cool and I wanted to give them store credit.",
    "expiration_days": 365,
    "vesting_days": 45
}'
```

